        ":question/id": "163a8b40-6ca1-5639-85fd-4bbe902adfb7",
        ":question/problem": "Calculate $\\int \\frac{7{x}^{4}}{{(11-{x}^{5})}^{6}}\\,\\text{d}x.$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Let $u=11-{x}^{5}.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-5{x}^{4}\\,\u27f9\\,-\\frac{7}{5}\\text{d}u=7{x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x,\n$$\n\nand we can solve the resulting integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{7{x}^{4}}{{(11-{x}^{5})}^{6}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{(11-{x}^{5})}^{6}}\\cdot 7{x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{{u}^{6}}\\cdot (-\\frac{7}{5})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{5}\\int \\frac{1}{{u}^{6}}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{5}(-\\frac{1}{5{u}^{5}})+C \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{25{u}^{5}}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{25(11-{x}^{5})^{5}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
